<title>USA: Developers Diversified to offer 3 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Developers Diversified to offer 3 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Developers Diversified Realty Corp said on Wednesday that it is offering 3.0 million shares of its common stock at a price of $36.625 a share.</p>
<p>The offering was increased to 3,000,000 shares from 2,500,000 shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The company has granted the underwriters a 30-day option to purchase up to an additional 450,000 common shares to cover over- allotments, if any, it said.</p>
<p>Dean Witter Reynolds Inc is the lead manager of the underwriting group, Developers Diversified said.</p>
</text>
